{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起过去亲近的日子，重新感到温暖，也有了继续把日子过好的劲头。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"温暖、怀念、振作、克制\",\n      \"missed\": \"首句中盼望以后还能拥有亲近、决定不再和过去较劲的完整意思，需要读句才能抓全。粉色音乐描写和右侧前情导航也不容易一眼读完。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他从回忆带来的热度和冲劲中慢下来，担心很久才能再次遇见亲近的人，心情逐渐平静。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、兴奋、不安、平静\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的快速八度、像被气流推着跑等音乐画面，字号较小，需要专门读。首段中希望未来仍有亲近、决定不再和过去较劲的完整关系也不容易一次抓全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他开始接受亲近的人未必很快出现：如果遇到会珍惜，如果没有也继续好好生活，不为了挽留别人委屈自己。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、不安、平静、释然、坚定\",\n      \"missed\": \"紫色段落下方关于冲势收敛、成功是否牢固的说明，以及绿色段落下方低音、高音和结尾的音乐解读，内容较多且字号较小，一眼难以抓全。尤其最后高音可理解为决定或梦醒的两种解释，需要逐句读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主要问题在扫读而非内容串联。三段人物叙述本身有清楚的递进关系：想起亲近而重新振作，冲劲减弱后担心难再遇见亲近的人，最后接受现实并决定不委屈自己。但每段句子内部都有多层意思，彩色强调往往只突出情绪词或结论，条件和因果关系藏在未强调的文字里。一眼容易抓到心里热了、怕很久、会珍惜、不为留人咽委屈，却未必马上拼出完整处境。第三张增加的音乐说明进一步提高了扫读负担，不过音乐的起伏与人物情绪变化总体是对应的，并没有形成明显的互不相干。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "48760be1-2b7c-453d-8c25-19e99c47dd72", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004455605293Z", "elapsed_seconds": 87.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:46:23.251090+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07218261a941db644df436c0d4af4e4a965d2f7d816994bd62b0656df35a63ae", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004455605293Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "0a895b455cfe06ffd5bae4d8fb800211c90939bb7d8af2db9de9939037b478a1"}}}
